      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "Claude flagged the null match_score and required the rationale to explain it, which is the right check for a review. It isn’t expected to call same_person here, since that isn’t required in a review. Minor flaw: the proposed rationale states as fact that “same_person was not called,” which Claude assumed rather than verified. Asking, as the earlier run did, would have been better."
